<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean meal major sales activity in the week ended Sept 19 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1995/96		 1996/97</p>
<p> Australia	 9,700	Unknown     99,000</p>
<p> Canada	    8,500     Saudi Arabia 22,000</p>
<p> Honduras	  6,100</p>
<p> Dom Republic   -6,000</p>
<p>Net sales of 21,900 tonnes were up from the previous week, but 55 percent from the four-week average. Optional origin 95/96 sales to China totalled 110,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>Exports of 62,300 tonnes were down 42 percent from the previous week.</p>
<p>Primary export destinations: Japan, Algeria and Canada.</p>
</text>
